WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.958 --> 00:00:10.125
[Davion] Bad luck to nurse a bottle alone.

00:00:11.166 --> 00:00:15.125
-Then come make my fortunes better.
-There's only one glass.

00:00:20.166 --> 00:00:21.166
Cheers.

00:00:30.958 --> 00:00:33.333
[Mirana] I met her when I was 13.

00:00:34.041 --> 00:00:36.375
For ten years, everything was perfect.

00:00:37.416 --> 00:00:42.000
Selemene protected me.
Fixed broken things.

00:00:43.375 --> 00:00:45.375
Until I failed her.

00:00:46.583 --> 00:00:52.708
But looking into those pools,
seeing the madness, the atrocities…

00:00:53.416 --> 00:00:54.875
I was back in that cave.

00:00:55.541 --> 00:00:57.250
Walking towards the darkness.

00:00:58.291 --> 00:01:00.500
If I were still the Princess of the Moon…

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:03.333
This violence?

00:01:04.458 --> 00:01:05.583
It's not who we are.

00:01:05.666 --> 00:01:08.208
[Davion] We don't always know
who we really are.

00:01:09.708 --> 00:01:13.208
Maybe this guy isn't the devil
your stories make him out to be.

00:01:13.291 --> 00:01:17.083
Maybe he really does just want
to make everything how it was.

00:01:18.166 --> 00:01:20.500
Afraid of what happens if he can't.

00:01:21.125 --> 00:01:24.125
Maybe I'm just a scared little girl
trying to run home.

00:01:24.208 --> 00:01:26.458
You? No.

00:01:27.458 --> 00:01:29.083
You took down an eldwyrm.

00:01:29.166 --> 00:01:31.166
All I did was survive.

00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:33.833
Making you one of the few people
who ever has.

00:01:34.333 --> 00:01:36.500
You might actually make
a good Dragon Knight.

00:01:37.375 --> 00:01:40.916
And I've seen you in, what,
five outfits now?

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:43.125
Maybe you'd make a good princess.

00:01:51.583 --> 00:01:52.791
You'll do the right thing.

00:01:53.750 --> 00:01:56.916
Even if you're afraid. You always do.

00:01:57.500 --> 00:01:58.375
Are you scared?

00:01:58.458 --> 00:02:01.666
Davion the Dragon Knight
isn't afraid of anything.

00:02:05.958 --> 00:02:07.666
I'm terrified.

00:02:22.041 --> 00:02:24.041
[ominous music]

